	(text "P1: the BQ25895 asks HVDCP/MaxCharge adapters for 9-12 V by default (REG02 reset values). R21/R22 are DNP," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9f4ac57a-4884-5c5c-a028-1e48dc0cdbae"))
	(text "    so the charger never sees D+/D-: VBUS stays at 5 V and the input limit resets to 500 mA. VBUS parts are" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 29.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e8afbe01-9401-5b67-ab1e-56d5865056e5"))
	(text "    still rated for 12 V (U2 pin 5 is not on VBUS, D5 is a 15 V stand-off TVS) in case R21/R22 are fitted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 33.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02be93a8-700f-5285-b525-72b71b677dde"))
	(text "P3: ILIM 300R caps the input at 1.07/1.18/1.30 A, ONLY with \"ti,use-ilim-pin\" in the device tree." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 38.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "734214ec-fc29-55c5-a8c6-4c0b2966464c"))
	(text "P7: the charger resets to 2.048 A charge current and the cell (PKCELL LP785060) allows 1.5 A. With the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 42.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7c7aa757-a363-5758-b699-1cb776aa3dcc"))
	(text "    500 mA input default the cell sees about 0.6 A until Linux sets \"ti,charge-current\" (1.25 A)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 46.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05c36319-fb29-5d9d-b617-d9cc20fca27b"))
	(text "REQUIRED (David 2026-11-24): never draw the cell above its 1.5 A rating. U13 (TPS2553, RILIM 20k) limits" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 50.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2db76fe7-9f23-5fc0-b72d-10ce3bd50c21"))
	(text "    everything fed from VSYS_LIM (the 5 V boost and the backlight) to 1.215 / 1.295 / 1.375 A (TI SLVS841," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 54.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "24c22e1a-a45f-5a83-a488-4ff939cac844"))
	(text "    25 degC). At the limit VSYS_LIM sags, the boost under-voltage divider turns the 5 V rail off, and FAULT" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 59.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fc3df4a6-b580-5b74-89d8-1820167a2218"))
	(text "    tells the module. It is a backstop: software must keep the device below it. docs/power-budget.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 63.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2d4e7b53-2ff6-59b2-9751-221c455e8cbb"))
	(text "Fuel gauge MAX17048 (voltage-only, no sense resistor): CELL/VDD taken as a Kelvin tap from the cell + pad." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 67.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb8ccb02-18a7-52c2-b209-fe34ee3424a3"))
